      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk server fatigue sounds like a reach. like, why would it happen at the EXACT same time i start talking? and it's not just one server, it's all of them. it feels much more systematic than just people being \"uneasy.\" like, if the platform's engagement metrics can pick up on literally anything, wouldnt they be able to detect a mismatch in frequency or something? i feel like i'm being shadowbanned not just from groups, but from the whole digital social space. it's like my presence is being actively corrected by the system.",
